# The upload of a review build of the Storytime app (plan task 6.2, round 8).
#
# It keeps only what the storytime image needs: apps/storytime, packages, the root manifests,
# and the lock and workspace files. Gitignore has a strict rule: no rule re-includes a file
# below an ignored folder. So this file uses /apps/* plus !/apps/storytime, and never a bare *.
# The CD build does not use this file; it uses the root .gcloudignore.
/*
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/storytime
!/packages
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/turbo.json
!/.pnpmfile.cjs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*.json
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/service-account*.json
**/*-key.json
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.docker/
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.ppk
